  m_Name: 5 - Resource
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UtilityScriptIWrite::HintSO
  hintId: tutorial_resources
  isUnlockedByDefault: 1
  ignoreLock: 0
  title: Resources
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: '<b>Resources</b>


    There are five types of resources that can
    be collected during exploration.


    Mineral resources:

    - White Ore

    -
    Purple Essence

    - Black Ore


    Material resources:

    - Gear

    -
    Screw


    Each resource has different uses and values. Some are commonly used
    for upgrades, while others are required for unlocking advanced technology and
    repairing the ship.


    Resources found in deeper and more dangerous areas
    are usually more valuable.'
  isImageBig: 0
